               </titlePage>
               <titlePage label="Title page 2" xml:id="titlePage_da6d9dd0">
                  <p xml:id="idm36">Mærk: Aaret beregnes fra den 28. Mai, overensstemmende med Tidsregning / af 28de Mai 1831. / Januar. / Februar. / Marts. / April. / den 9de 1851 Foraaret begynder [drawing of a cupid with bow and arrow] (Skytten Himmelt.).</p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_59459395">48 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_e79221bf">28 x 23</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_5e337f1c">Bound in blue cardboard cover. Written in ink. Paper: 12 staves. Paginated 1-17. The remaining pages are unnumbered and blank. Heading on p. 2: "April. / Foraar. / den 13<rend xml:id="idm40" rend="sup">de</rend> (1851) Illinger." After the last bar dated "13<rend xml:id="idm41" rend="sup">de</rend> April 51" and Gade's musical signature.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
